---
// 当前路径（含尾斜杠归一化），用于高亮导航
const path = Astro.url.pathname.replace(/\/[^/]*$/, '/') || '/';
const links = [
  { href: '/', label: '首页' },
  { href: '/tangshi/', label: '唐诗' },
  { href: '/songci/', label: '宋词' },
  { href: '/qita/', label: '其他朝代' }
];
const current = links.find((l) => (l.href === '/' ? path === '/' : path.startsWith(l.href)))?.href;
---

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">🌙</span>
      <span class="brand-name">每天一首小古诗</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="主导航">
      {
        links.map((l) => (
          <a href={l.href} class:list={[{ active: current === l.href }]}>
            {l.label}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </nav>
    <button type="button" id="theme-toggle" class="theme-btn" aria-label="切换主题" title="切换主题">
      🌙
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<script>
  // 主题循环切换：日间 → 夜读 → 青绿，localStorage 记忆
  const THEMES = [
    ['light', '☀️'],
    ['night', '🌙'],
    ['green', '🏞️']
  ];
  const btn = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
  if (btn) {
    const setTheme = (t) => {
      document.documentElement.dataset.theme = t;
      localStorage.setItem('up999-theme', t);
      btn.textContent = THEMES.find((x) => x[0] === t)?.[1] ?? '☀️';
    };
    setTheme(document.documentElement.dataset.theme || 'light');
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const cur = document.documentElement.dataset.theme || 'light';
      const idx = THEMES.findIndex((x) => x[0] === cur);
      setTheme(THEMES[(idx + 1) % THEMES.length][0]);
    });
  }
</script>
